{
  "source": "course-assets/document-trap/document-trap.mp4",
  "duration": 172.2453125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.84,
      "text": "Your big season-end basketball tournament starts next week, so you definitely want to brush up on the rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.7,
      "end": 12.12,
      "text": "You upload your league's massive 200-page rulebook to an AI chatbot and ask a simple question,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.84,
      "end": 15.06,
      "text": "how many fouls until I'm out of the game?"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.96,
      "end": 20.52,
      "text": "ChatGPT answers instantly, with total confidence. Five fouls and you foul out."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.4,
      "end": 28.02,
      "text": "Wait a second. In last year's tournament, you specifically remember a player picking up five fouls and staying on the court."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.02,
      "end": 30.88,
      "text": "You dig through the physical rulebook yourself to check."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.58,
      "end": 35.76,
      "text": "The regular season section says exactly what the AI did, five fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.16,
      "end": 40.38,
      "text": "But buried near the back, there's a special section strictly for tournaments."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.04,
      "end": 42.66,
      "text": "In those games, players get six."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.4,
      "end": 46.4,
      "text": "The AI pulled the standard limit and missed the exception,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.92,
      "end": 50.34,
      "text": "delivering a factual but dangerously incomplete answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.92,
      "end": 52.5,
      "text": "This is the document trap,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.88,
      "end": 56.88,
      "text": "the assumption that an uploaded document is a fully understood document."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.519999999999996,
      "end": 61.48,
      "text": "Uploading a file doesn't mean the AI instantly memorizes every single word."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.16,
      "end": 67.06,
      "text": "A short file might fit entirely inside the AI's active memory, known as its context window."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.66,
      "end": 71.8,
      "text": "But when you ask a question about a long file, the system might search the document"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.8,
      "end": 74.9,
      "text": "and pull only the matching passages into that window."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.76,
      "end": 77.8,
      "text": "That highlights the flaw in the initial prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.42,
      "end": 83.58,
      "text": "You were thinking about a tournament, but failed to actually include the word tournament in your question."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.58,
      "end": 89.34,
      "text": "Because of that omission, the retrieval machine only pulled pages matching standard fouls."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.8,
      "end": 92.62,
      "text": "It left the AI completely blind to the tournament exception."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.32,
      "end": 94.5,
      "text": "Try asking it this way."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 97.54,
      "text": "In tournament games, how many fouls are allowed?"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.92,
      "end": 99.78,
      "text": "Quote, the rule and any exceptions."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.92,
      "end": 108.54,
      "text": "Given that precise target, the AI's corrected answer now successfully acknowledges the explicit six foul allowance for league tournaments."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.34,
      "end": 113.02,
      "text": "This infographic outlines four tips for working with long documents."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.02,
      "end": 116.08,
      "text": "a systematic approach to make the right passages easier"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.08,
      "end": 117.6,
      "text": "for the retrieval machine to find."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.72,
      "end": 120.42,
      "text": "Step one, name the section."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.76,
      "end": 123.38,
      "text": "Use the document's own headings and keywords."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.44,
      "end": 126.0,
      "text": "Step two, ask one thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.34,
      "end": 128.96,
      "text": "Give retrieval one clear target at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.74,
      "end": 131.32,
      "text": "Step three, share what matters."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.76,
      "end": 133.0,
      "text": "Paste the exact passage"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.0,
      "end": 135.42,
      "text": "or upload only the relevant section."
    },
    {
      "start": 136.34,
      "end": 138.42,
      "text": "Finally, step four, ask for the quote."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.86,
      "end": 141.22,
      "text": "Ask AI to quote the exact passage,"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.22,
      "end": 143.16,
      "text": "then compare it with the original."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.2,
      "end": 146.38,
      "text": "These four moves will organize your evidence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.6,
      "end": 149.34,
      "text": "but they do not guarantee a complete answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 150.22,
      "end": 153.24,
      "text": "The document trap extends far beyond the basketball court."
    },
    {
      "start": 153.88,
      "end": 154.94,
      "text": "Here in the real world,"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.42,
      "end": 157.42,
      "text": "dense paperwork like apartment leases,"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.9,
      "end": 159.5,
      "text": "complex employment contracts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.64,
      "end": 160.9,
      "text": "and financial aid letters"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.9,
      "end": 162.98,
      "text": "can only hide conditions or exceptions"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.98,
      "end": 165.4,
      "text": "that can completely change your bottom line."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.24,
      "end": 168.38,
      "text": "Uploaded doesn't mean fully read."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.38,
      "end": 171.06,
      "text": "ask for the rule and any exceptions."
    }
  ],
